OL,3,GNEWSAAll-day bagels in Royal Navy
OL,4,A'modern' meals trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FSailors on a Royal Navy warship are
OL,7,Fbeing offered salmon bagels and other
OL,8,Fsnacks to stop them missing meals due
OL,9,Fto work demands.
OL,11,FPaninis and fruit salad are other
OL,12,Flight-bite options in the new "grazing
OL,13,Fgalley" on aircraft carrier HMS Queen
OL,14,FElizabeth.
OL,16,FThe Portsmouth-based warship has been
OL,17,Fchosen as a testbed for the Navy's new
OL,18,F"all-day dining" programme to suit
OL,19,Fshift times and military exercises.
OL,21,FIt said main meals would also still be
OL,22,Favailable for those who want them.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
